# ...except the web export's own assets. `expo export` mirrors the source path
# of every bundled font and icon, so they land under assets/node_modules/ and
# the rule above silently dropped them from the deploy — which is why the
# bundle's 79 font requests have been 404ing on datariot.xyz.
!datariot-xyz/assets/node_modules/
!datariot-xyz/assets/node_modules/**
